[0, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[2J\u001b[H \u001b[38;5;252m>\u001b[38;5;179m\u25cf\u001b[39m \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;110mcodeaf\u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;110m home  teams \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;146m chats \u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;110m sessions  spend  settings \u001b[39m                                                              \u001b[38;5;115m$0.28\u001b[39m \u00b7 \u001b[38;5;243msun 1:24pm\u001b[39m\r\n \u001b[38;5;243m \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;237m\u001b[48;5;252m   september reimbursement report handoff process \u00d7 \u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;243m  +   \u25a6\u001b[38;5;110m All \u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;243m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n\r\n\r\n\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;5;146m\u203a \u001b[38;5;110mI need a finance-ready September reimbursement handoff from \u001b[4m\u001b]8;;file:///tmp/codeaf-sustained-1607/final/reimbursement-project/september-reimbursements.csv\u001b\\september-reimbursements.csv\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;110m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\. This directory has an expense-report\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;110mprototype from our earlier work. Inspect it and use or improve it so I can reproduce the report next month, with totals by category\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;110mand a grand total. Do not silently include questionable amounts. Save the usable report and a short handoff explaining how to run it\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;110mand any data problems. Verify the actual output before you hand it over; work directly for now.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n    \u001b[38;5;243m\u25b8 worked \u00b7 2 steps \u00b7 8 tool calls \u00b7 ctrl+e\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;243m\u2514 \u001b[38;5;103mOne finance requirement while you work: they import CSV, so include a machine-readable category summary with exact cents, not just a\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;103mMarkdown report. Keep the original source file unchanged and make any excluded rows obvious in the handoff.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252minspecting \u001b[4m\u001b]8;;file:///tmp/codeaf-sustained-1607/final/reimbursement-project/report.py\u001b\\report.py\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\, tests, and CSV directly via bash\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;243m\u25b8 worked \u00b7 1 tool call \u00b7 ctrl+e\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mrunning the report and test suite to verify against the live CSV\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;243m\u25b8 worked \u00b7 2 steps \u00b7 4 tool calls \u00b7 ctrl+e\u001b[39m\r\n                                                                                                                                           \u001b[38;5;252m\u276e\r\n\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;5;252mwriting the handoff, then fixing the three fixture-dependent tests\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;243m\u25b8 worked \u00b7 3 tool calls \u00b7 ctrl+e\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mcleaning the bytecode cache and doing a final check of the artifacts\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;243m\u25b8 worked \u00b7 1 tool call \u00b7 ctrl+e\r\n\r\n\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;5;252mdone\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mThe report is saved and verified against the live CSV; the source file is untouched.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;252mNumbers (provisional \u2014 see below):\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;252m books